pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$background"
elements:
  - elementId: ms-accent
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 50, 4, 28]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"
  - elementId: ms-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 48, 1000, 34]
    content:
      style: "$subtitle"
      fontSize: 26
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>Módulo 4 — Seguimiento de progreso y recomendaciones</p>
  - elementId: ms-card-1
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 110, 360, 230]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [12000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$cardBg"
    shadow:
      blur: 10
      color: "#00000010"
      offset: [0, 3]
  - elementId: ms-c1-icon
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [90, 140, 32, 32]
    iconName: "fas:user-gear"
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"
  - elementId: ms-c1-head
    elementType: text
    bounds: [90, 185, 300, 24]
    content:
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$primary"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>AdaptiveProfile</strong></p>
  - elementId: ms-c1-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [90, 215, 300, 110]
    content:
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$text"
      align: [left, top]
      lineHeight: 1.5
      text: |
        <p>θ por curso, weak_topics, strong_topics, recommended_difficulty. Único por (user, course).</p>
  - elementId: ms-card-2
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [460, 110, 360, 230]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [12000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$cardBg"
    shadow:
      blur: 10
      color: "#00000010"
      offset: [0, 3]
  - elementId: ms-c2-icon
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [490, 140, 32, 32]
    iconName: "fas:arrow-trend-up"
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$info"
  - elementId: ms-c2-head
    elementType: text
    bounds: [490, 185, 300, 24]
    content:
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$primary"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>StudentAnswer</strong></p>
  - elementId: ms-c2-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [490, 215, 300, 110]
    content:
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$text"
      align: [left, top]
      lineHeight: 1.5
      text: |
        <p>Cada respuesta guarda theta_before y theta_after. Evolución de habilidad trazable en el tiempo por curso y por tema.</p>
  - elementId: ms-card-3
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [860, 110, 360, 230]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [12000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$cardBg"
    shadow:
      blur: 10
      color: "#00000010"
      offset: [0, 3]
  - elementId: ms-c3-icon
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [890, 140, 32, 32]
    iconName: "fas:bullseye"
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$warning"
  - elementId: ms-c3-head
    elementType: text
    bounds: [890, 185, 300, 24]
    content:
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$primary"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>Recommendation</strong></p>
  - elementId: ms-c3-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [890, 215, 300, 110]
    content:
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$text"
      align: [left, top]
      lineHeight: 1.5
      text: |
        <p>Sistema de recomendaciones pendientes / completadas / descartadas con prioridad (1-5) y fecha límite.</p>
  - elementId: ms-lower
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 370, 1160, 250]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [8000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "#e8f5e0"
  - elementId: ms-lower-icon
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [90, 400, 32, 32]
    iconName: "fas:chart-column"
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"
  - elementId: ms-lower-head
    elementType: text
    bounds: [90, 445, 400, 24]
    content:
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$primary"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>Dashboard de progreso</strong></p>
  - elementId: ms-lower-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [90, 480, 1100, 120]
    content:
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      fontSize: 15
      color: "$text"
      align: [left, top]
      lineHeight: 1.6
      text: |
        <p>• Cursos activos, clases creadas, materiales listos, meta diaria configurable</p>
        <p>• Heatmap de actividad, racha actual, nivel y XP totales</p>
        <p>• StudyActivity tracking: XP y tiempo por actividad (clase subida, resumen revisado, flashcards repasadas, quiz completado)</p>
        <p>• Modelos: Profile, UserPreference, StudyStreak, CreditLedgerEntry</p>
  - elementId: ms-footer-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 660, 40, 3]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"
